69","name":"春夏 ひとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3360","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12628","characterName":"スゥ、カク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12628"},"originalCharacterName":"スゥ、カク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suu and Kaku accompanied Arcie from the start. However, even Arcie herself doesn't know who they are and where they came from. But do not think that it's just a cute little animals that are good for nothing. They'll surprise you for sure."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12628"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e704845f5a078477ef6d65cedb91ab7f53bf0bfe506d5ec3892884252a85f80.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b2ba674973d256fe11848efdb1b9abfc074aadcf0bd3615f3bda5bed8658912.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 涼","creatorId":"vndb:s2226","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2226","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2226","name":"伊藤涼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3370","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"山田 菜穂","creatorId":"vndb:s2235","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2235","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2235","name":"山田 菜穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3372","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12629","characterName":"プリル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12629"},"originalCharacterName":"プリル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Who is she? Where are her parents? What is she seeking? A mysterious girl that keeps the mighty sword in her body, has become part of dangerous adventure along with Caro and five \"Flowers\". She knows something that others do not know. She carries an excessive burden on her shoulders. But friends will never leave her in trouble, so she could feel herself an ordinary child and enjoy life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12629"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c41fd3b2179e4bd1ee2f9647760fc214650ea0ec7c8a8f20b412d5adf2b2ced4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be0adce69053c0b7c7e8bf2755d2d99c231f68a5df612f0d47a44744f9a0cdec.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3357","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12630","characterName":"エフメル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12630"},"originalCharacterName":"エフメル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shinobi who only occasionally make an appearance, just to exchange a few words with Arcie. In the past Arcie had saved her, and now Efmel spares no effort to protect her and obtain a useful information for her. But who is she? A good friend or a loyal servant?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12630"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1